WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.796
Each order on Orders shows its status.

00:00:04.682 --> 00:00:14.144
The status follows the goods: Received at SASH Faridabad, Dispatched, Inbound at SASH US, and Outbound, which means delivered to John Deere.

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:17.878
To change it, click the status, and choose the new one.

00:00:17.878 --> 00:00:19.667
Then enter the date, and save.

00:00:20.118 --> 00:00:26.027
Statuses go in order, and most change by themselves when an invoice or dispatch list is uploaded.
